  "description": "Wink is the AI video and photo enhancer that fixes any clip in one tap. Upscale to 4K HD, restore old videos, unblur photos — old home videos, phone footage, whatever you've got.\n\n[ PERFECT FOR ]\n\n• Restoring old family videos, VHS tapes, and home movies\n• Fixing blurry, shaky, or low-quality phone footage\n• Upscaling videos for trending short-form video platforms\n• Reviving faded photos and damaged memories\n• Polishing night-out clips, travel vlogs, and gaming highlights\n• Anyone who wants pro-quality video without the editing skills\n\n[ VIDEO & PHOTO ENHANCER ]\n\n• HD Quality Enhancer: Fix blurry, low-quality videos and photos — no editing skills needed\n• 4K Super Resolution: Upscale 480p and 720p videos into crisp 4K Ultra HD\n• Adjustable Enhancement: Fine-tune the fix strength to keep results natural — no over-processed AI look\n• 7 Scene-Specific Models: Dedicated fixes for gaming clips, night-out footage, old photo restoration, and more\n• AI Repair Pro: Auto mode detects quality iss...",
  "release_notes": "・Face Retouch: New “De-puff” — reduce facial puffiness in one tap\n・Hair Part Filler: New \"Max\" intensity just dropped — fuller coverage for thinning parts\n・Body Retouch: New “Slim Arms” — easily refine your arm contours\n・AI Removal: Now removes clutter, vehicles, mirror smudges, glass reflections, and tattoos from photos\n・Siri support: open features instantly with just your voice",
